                <pb facs="1006" n="908" sameAs="frus:frus1900/pg908"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Griscom to Mr. Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Constantinople</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1900-06-15"><hi rendition="#italic">June 15,
                        1900</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>[Mr. Griscom reports that he is assured by the secretary of the Sultan that
                    indemnity claims will be settled within three or four months, that some indirect
                    method of payment is referred to, and that he has requested an official answer
                    from the minister for foreign affairs.]</p>
            </div>
